    "preamble": "Girraj Prasad S/O Late Shri Prabhu Dayal vs State Of Rajasthan",
    "facts": "Both the material witnesses namely PW-1 Omveer Singh and PW-2 Rajkumar Sharma have admitted that no stirring was properly made by the food inspector prior to taking the sample.",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioner submits that the accused- petitioner was on bail during trial as well as during pendency of the appeal. Counsel further submits that the matter pertains to the year 2000, since then no case has been registered against the accused-petitioner for any offence under Prevention of Food (2 of 2) [CRLR-1075/2018] Adulteration Act and the accused-petitioner is in custody since 27.06.2018.",
